{
  "chapter": "STEAM_AGE",
  "description": "The strongest physical storage options are here! As of now, you can either make the §7wrought iron backpack§r, or the §6bronze chest/barrel§r to store many types of items as you go through the tiers to increase space further.

They both have two upgrade slots with many cool upgrades being obtainable now, or very soon such as the §afeeding upgrade§r, the §amagnet upgrade§r, and the §astack upgrade§r.

You can upgrade your chests later in the crafting table, or with an item upgrade by shift right-clicking it on there. So feel free to make as many chests or backpacks and upgrades later.

They also fare really well when being used in tandem with the §3crafting station§r. Moreover, they can be easily and strongly filtered for all manner of automation needs!",
